{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"base","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18ReversedCollectionV4Basexmfp","text":"Base","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Collection\/Index"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To find the position that corresponds with this index in the original,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"underlying collection, use that collection’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index(before:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"base"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example declares a function that returns the index of the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"last even number in the passed array, if one is found. First, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"function finds the position of the last even number as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ReversedIndex"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"in a reversed view of the array of numbers. Next, the function calls the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"index(before:)"},{"text":" method to return the correct position in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"passed array."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["func indexOfLastEven(_ numbers: [Int]) -> Int? {","    let reversedNumbers = numbers.reversed()","    guard let i = reversedNumbers.firstIndex(where: { $0 % 2 == 0 })","        else { return nil }","","    return numbers.index(before: i.base)","}","","let numbers = [10, 20, 13, 19, 30, 52, 17, 40, 51]","if let lastEven = indexOfLastEven(numbers) {","    print(\"Last even number: \\(numbers[lastEven])\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"Last even number: 40\""]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ReversedCollection","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ReversedCollection\/Index"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The position after this position in the underlying collection."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ReversedCollection\/Index\/base"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:s18ReversedCollectionV5IndexV4baseACQzvp","symbolKind":"property","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iPadOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"10.10","name":"macOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"tvOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"2.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"title":"base","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"base"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18ReversedCollectionV4Basexmfp","text":"Base"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdenti